WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.510
I spent 18 years in operations
across a multitude of organizations,

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:05.150
and one thing remained constant:

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.960
when knowledge lives in the
minds of individuals rather

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.950
than in the systems
of an organization,

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:12.740
that knowledge walks out
the door when they do.

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:14.240
Whether you run a production floor,

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:15.900
a warehouse, or a therapy clinic,

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:17.010
the fix is the same:

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.300
clear SOPs your team can
actually follow with easy

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.870
access to them at the
time and place of need.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.700
This is SOP Builder Pro.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.390
Everything lives in
the Process Library.

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:28.440
Each procedure shows its owner,

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:29.680
its scorecard metric,

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:32.210
and whether it's current
or due for review.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.230
Let's build one!

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:36.810
We’ll do an end-of-shift handoff.

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:38.430
In the Procedure Charter,

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:41.070
I add a title, pick a process owner,

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:44.170
tie it to a KPI, and
set a review interval.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:46.570
Then I build it step by step.

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:49.010
Drop in a screenshot or short video,

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:50.350
write the instruction,

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:52.090
name the step owner,

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.250
and flag any handoff
to the next shift.

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:57.450
And when I click Publish Procedure,

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:59.330
Private keeps it inside the workspace.

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:04.130
Public gives your team a secure
link they can open on a phone,

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:05.300
no login.

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:06.620
Want to print the procedure?

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:10.230
Print-for-Floor gives a clean
copy to post by the workstation,

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:13.280
and a QR code is available
to see a walkthrough on a

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.870
personal device without
all the sign-in friction.

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:18.130
Builder Pro is $39 a
month at pay.sopmojo.com.

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.270
Or grab the free SOP
Starter Kit at sopmojo.com.

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:25.290
Pick one process this week.
